<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Macmahon issue closes oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Macmahon issue closes oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining contractor and civil engineering group Macmahon Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its A$44 million converting preference share issue closed significantly oversubcribed.</p>
<p>Macmahon said the funds raised from the issue would be used partly to repay debt and partly to finance capital requirements of the company's business.</p>
<p>The converting shares would list on Friday with each converting share to convert into one ordinary share on November 15, 2000 and, subject to market conditions, a bonus issue of one share per converting preference share would be made.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
